-- the inference a crystal energy landscape is used to make: that the most stable candidate is the form
-- that is observed. Stated as what it is — a claim about a ranking and a record of observation, not a
-- consequence of either.
MinimumIsObserved : (L : Landscape) → (ls-idx L → Nat) → (ls-idx L → Bool) → Type 0
MinimumIsObserved L r obs = (i : ls-idx L) → ((j : ls-idx L) → isTrue (leb (r i) (r j))) → isTrue (obs i)
